        serving. Coverage can be expanded as the network grows.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
        <strong>Nationwide Partner Network</strong><br>
        Partner coverage is being built across all 50 states and
        Washington, DC.
    </div>
</section>

<section class="card">
    <h2>How Leads Can Work</h2>

    <p>
        When customers request appliance pickup, qualifying opportunities
        can be matched with partners serving that area.
    </p>

